# Frontend Environment Configuration - DEV CLOUD
# This value is set at BUILD TIME via Docker build argument
# This file is for documentation only - values are set during deployment

# API Base URL (set via Docker build --build-arg)
# VITE_API_URL is set to the backend-dev Cloud Run URL during build
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://uw-workbench-backend-dev-xxxxx-uc.a.run.app

# Note: In Cloud Run, VITE_API_URL is baked into the static build
# The URL is determined during deployment and passed as build argument
